	(paper "A2")
	(lib_symbols)
	(text "BugBot Vision Board" (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 4.0 4.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "10a0a620-59b4-511a-96cf-f5ad3e4f1553"))
	(text "Top of the two-board stack: Waveshare ESP32-P4-Module (P4 + C6 WiFi6), MIPI camera, gimbal servos, 8x8 ToF. The robot's only processor." (at 25.4 32.0 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "95eec042-f82d-5bff-9f68-3286436abd11"))
	(text "Signal flow runs left to right. GND is global; 3V3, VMOT and the I2C bus are joined by name on short stubs. 3V3 arrives clean from the Motion board's converter: no regulator on this board." (at 25.4 37.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "b19b25cb-f325-50ad-9ecc-8346fb28246f"))
	(text "Stack: J8 = 3V3 + I2C (motor drivers, IMU) + MOT_INT + VBAT_SENSE + VMOT; J9 = odometry SPI + IMU_CS/INT + USB (D-/D+ to the Motion board's USB-C). The Motion board's S3 is gone: its next revision is a power-and-drive board." (at 25.4 310.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "757746ee-d6aa-5adc-8b43-de0c90a4d1e8"))
	(text "The module is hand-soldered after JLCPCB assembly (not a stock part). Camera: OV5647 head on a 22-pin Pi Zero flex." (at 25.4 315.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "1e95be75-ef64-53c6-94cc-b6461b7260fe"))
